ÿØÿÛ«symbol SR-Flip-flop
  «type: X»
  «description: (PLECS) SR Flip-flop [level trigger]»
  «library file: |.subckt SR-Flip-flop S R Q ¬Q\nB1 Q 0 V=if(((V(S)>thre)&(V(R)<=thre)),1, if(((V(S)<=thre)&(V(R)>thre)),0, if(((V(S)<=thre)&(V(R)<thre)),V(memory),V(restricted)) ) )\nB2 memory 0 V=if(time<=0,x_init,state(1,V(Q)))\nB3 ¬Q 0 V=!V(Q)\nB4 restricted 0 V=if(restricted==-1,V(memory),if(restricted==0,0,1))\n.ends SR-Flip-flop»
  «shorted pins: false»
  «rect (-300,300) (300,-300) 0 0 0 0x1000000 0xc8ffe6 -1 0 -1»
